{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you\u2019ll experience the first three episodes of an exciting adventure! Petya and the Wolf are returning home with their cat when suddenly Petya\u2019s parents mysteriously teleport to an unknown location. The friends immediately set off to find them and find themselves traveling through parallel worlds, where they must solve numerous puzzles and help new characters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These first three episodes are just the beginning of a grand journey, with every step bringing you closer to uncovering the mystery of Petya\u2019s parents\u2019 disappearance. Enjoy engaging dialogues voiced by the original cast of the &quot;Adventures of Petya and the Wolf&quot; animated series, along with plenty of hints to help you overcome even the toughest challenges.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just five more minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873180/df53eb1c989777e9a17f6d641b19e43528b8d8fa.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Rescuer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873180/a7276c3dd269bcc2989a9976fe14cef3125c1b47.jpg"},{"name":"Just five more minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873180/ab0a43237aa27655665bc3d50a8b342af8bbf875.jpg"},{"name":"Old friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873180/c6a65a3e27584d1540d2241fd4f1a24279507b0c.jpg"},{"name":"Oh, my dungeon!...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873180/59037a9348a026e64405806edb25070e33ca5270.jpg"},{"name":"Secret tool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873180/5053f9e91dca61df941bde6aa77c265b713010d0.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a hacker at my mom's","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873180/0c124c95551eaa3a599fab96f85adc9